  "name": "Frontier Lab release gate policy",
  "description": "Canonical blocker/advisory policy for the final Item 13 release decision and FrontierOS foundation/app invariants, including explicit per-gate timeout budgets and UI-mode ownership.",
  "decisionRule": "Release passes only when every blocker gate executes successfully within its timeout, required blocker evidence exists, and semantic evidence checks produce zero blockers. Legacy Item 13 inventory gates run with FrontierOS disabled; P5.x gates run against the real FrontierOS defaults. Advisories are reported but do not change the release decision.",
